/* Team-Specific  */
Team: XNCH
Website: https://xnch.ai
Contact: founders@xnch.ai
Language: English

/* Code Preferences */
Tabs: 2 spaces
Quoting: single quotes
Semicolons: yes
End of line: LF
Insert final newline: yes

/* Project Context */
Project Type: Next.js website with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS
Purpose: Minimal, production-ready website for XNCH AI initiative
Design: Modern research lab aesthetic - clean, minimal, typography-focused
Tone: Intellectually calm, high-agency, quiet confidence

/* Architecture */
- App Router (src/app/)
- Static site generation where possible
- Component-based architecture
- No heavy animation libraries
- Optimized for performance and accessibility

/* Coding Style */
- TypeScript strict mode
- Functional components with hooks
- Semantic HTML5
- Tailwind utility classes
- Clean, readable code favored over cleverness
- No comments unless explaining complex logic

/* Key Principles */
- Intelligence must be guided, not just scaled
- Technology should deepen human capability, not erode it
- Calm, thoughtful systems will outlast reactive ones
- Serious infrastructure is built quietly before it is recognized loudly